  "description": "Expose opted-in CQRS Commands and Queries as Microsoft.Extensions.AI tools, dispatched in-process over MediatR's IMediator, and host them behind typed Microsoft Agent Framework agents. Coexists with MapCommand/MapQuery HTTP endpoints; tool calls run through the same validation/logging/cache/lock/enricher pipeline.\n      Commonly used types:\n      Cnblogs.Architecture.Ddd.Cqrs.AgentFramework.ICqrsAgent\n      Cnblogs.Architecture.Ddd.Cqrs.AgentFramework.CqrsAgent\n      Cnblogs.Architecture.Ddd.Cqrs.AgentFramework.AgentToolAttribute\n      Cnblogs.Architecture.Ddd.Cqrs.AgentFramework.CqrsAgentOptions\n      Cnblogs.Architecture.Ddd.Cqrs.AgentFramework.CqrsToolSet\n      Cnblogs.Architecture.Ddd.Cqrs.AgentFramework.CqrsInjectorExtensions\n      Cnblogs.Architecture.Ddd.Cqrs.AgentFramework.CqrsAgentEndpointExtensions",
